🛒 Vrinda Store Data Analysis 📊 (Excel-Based)

This project presents a comprehensive Excel-based analysis of sales, inventory, and customer behavior for Vrinda Store, a fictional retail business. Leveraging Excel's powerful features, this analysis provides clear insights into store performance and business trends — all without writing a single line of code.

🔍 What’s Inside?

📆 Sales Trend Analysis – Monthly and weekly sales breakdowns

📦 Inventory Insights – Stock movement, slow movers, and restock alerts

👥 Customer Behavior – Purchase patterns, high-value customers, and frequency

💰 Revenue & Profit Tracking – Product-wise and category-wise profitability

📊 Interactive Dashboards – Easy-to-use Excel dashboards for instant insights

💡 Key Features

Pivot Tables & Pivot Charts for dynamic analysis

Conditional formatting to highlight key trends

Slicers & drop-down filters for interactivity

Clean, user-friendly design – no coding needed!

🛠️ Tools Used
Microsoft Excel (Formulas, Charts, PivotTables, Dashboards)

Data Cleaning & Transformation within Excel

Visual storytelling through professional formatting and charts

✅ Ideal For:
Beginners exploring Excel for business analysis

Small businesses needing insight without complex tools

Portfolio project to showcase Excel proficiency

📂 Files Included
Vrinda_Store_Analysis.xlsx – Complete analysis & dashboards

Raw_Data.xlsx – Unprocessed data for reference

README.md – Project overview and usage guide
